    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nfor every `:Man` invocation, the groff machinery does time-consuming work before passing data to the lua plugin, which then does more time-consuming work. for a large manpage like `configuration.nix`, it can take upwards of 12 seconds to load on my old laptop. then i close it, hours later i want to open it again, and i have to suffer these 12 seconds. it could be faster\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nlarge manpages load blazingly fast. like 2 seconds? compared to 12 it is blazingly fast",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-06T10:45:12Z",
    "closed_by": {
