            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "that's in the same session, yes. it takes the same amount of time to render it a second, third, fourth time as it did the first time. i made sure to double check with --clean and physically moving my config elsewhere for good measure, yet it behaves the same\n\nwell, originally it was about multiple sessions and with `MANPAGER=\"nvim +Man!\"`, but it's broken in the way you described too",
